     3	
     4	/// The photo book in the bag's third pair of pages: a theme, and one Koco
     5	/// picture a day put into it. Days in a row earn the issue's roll. Kept only
     6	/// on this iPhone (Application Support/books.json), no account, nothing sent.
     7	///
     8	/// A day counts when a picture taken that day with Koco is put in that same
     9	/// day (one a day; putting in another replaces it). Days are calendar days in
    10	/// the time zone the book was started in, so travelling does not move them.
    11	/// A missed day starts the count again; the pictures already in stay.
    12	@MainActor
    13	final class BookStore: ObservableObject {
    14	    static let shared = BookStore()
    15	
    16	    struct Entry: Codable, Equatable {
    17	        let asset: String       // PHAsset.localIdentifier
